flowchart TD
    H[Human or CI intent] --> C[Markdown research contracts]
    C --> R[YAML recipe graph]
    R --> A[Selected Agent Adapter]

    subgraph OP[Modular Pluggable Operator Plane]
      A --> CR[CrewAI specialist roles<br/>optional]
      CR --> RP[Role plugins<br/>planner researcher analyst verifier reporter]
      A --> SP[Skill plugins<br/>SKILL.md scripts eval provenance]
      A --> MP[MCP plugins<br/>scoped tools]
    end

    A --> X[Agent operates and executes]
    RP -. structured role results .-> X
    SP -. declared capabilities .-> X
    MP -. scoped integrations .-> X

    X --> P[Plan / Review / Approval]
    P --> V[Provision disposable Lima / QEMU VM]
    V --> I[Start instrumentation]
    I --> W[Execute approved workload]
    W --> E[Collect raw evidence + telemetry]
    E --> B[Blackboard / durable case store]

    subgraph BB[Blackboard]
      B --> AR[Artifacts + provenance]
      B --> AU[Run + audit records]
      B --> FN[Findings + evidence analysis]
      B --> VR[Verification results]
      B --> RR[Research report + technical details]
    end

    VR --> L[Self-learning loop]
    RR --> L
    L --> SC[Candidate skill / recipe improvement]
    SC --> RE[Replay on distinct artifact]
    RE --> IV[Independent verification]
    IV --> HA[Human approval]
    HA --> VS[Validated versioned skill]
    VS --> SP

    B --> PR[Preserve + hash evidence]
    PR --> D[Destroy disposable VM]

    PC[policyctl<br/>outside agent control plane] -. policy signal / audit .-> P
    SEC[VM/OS security boundary<br/>mounts credentials privilege network] --- V

    classDef declarative fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#3b82f6
    classDef pluggable fill:#fff7e6,stroke:#f59e0b
    classDef data fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#8b5cf6
    classDef security fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#16a34a
    class C,R declarative
    class A,CR,RP,SP,MP pluggable
    class B,AR,AU,FN,VR,RR data
    class V,SEC security

    %% Invariant: no agent, role, skill, MCP server or orchestrator is the sandbox.
